Review the recentUsers limit report

A scanner flagged the query in recentUsers as SQL text built by string
concatenation. The only concatenated operand is the decimal form of an
integer, and the guard on the single path to the query bounds it to
[0, 100), so no request text reaches the statement: not exploitable, and
the query is unchanged. Documented the check in a comment so the next
reader does not reopen it.
